{"what_is_happening":"币安中秋 ('Binance Mid-Autumn') is a Chinese-language meme timed to the Mid-Autumn Festival, which is around 25 Sept 2026. The pair was created directly on PumpSwap 3 seconds after the token was minted. It never went through a bonding curve (migrated_unix=0, no launchpad). It is about 36 minutes old, with a $20k market cap and $35.5k of liquidity. That is more liquidity than market cap, and all of it is unlocked and held by a few LP providers (RugCheck flags this as 'danger').

About $474k of volume came in within the first hour, 13x turnover. The buyer counts look manufactured: about 1,000 unique buyers show up only in the 15–30 minute window (m30 = 1,028 against m15 = 50), and the total is 2,055 unique buyers against only 53 unique sellers. Many wallets making one tiny buy each suggests holder-count and volume farming, not organic demand. Price has already slipped about 9% over the last 15 minutes, and buys and sells are now balanced.

The packet lists 10 other tokens with the identical name, all launched in the previous ~9 hours, and every one of them now shows $0 liquidity. That fits a serial launch-and-pull pattern around this theme.","narrative":{"description":"A seasonal Chinese meme that pairs Binance with the Mid-Autumn Festival. It fits the recurring Chinese-language/Binance meme wave on Solana and the festival is tomorrow, so the timing is real. But it is a generic holiday name with no project socials, site or description.","stage":"peaking","potential":"weak","why_spreading":"The holiday is tomorrow, and Chinese Binance-themed memes attract speculative flow. The spread looks bot-driven (one ~1k-buyer burst, very few sellers), not community-driven. There are no socials or DexScreener profile."},"token_connection":{"assessment":"weak","why_this_token":"It is simply the most recent same-name launch that still has liquidity. Nothing makes it the canonical one.","competing_tokens":"At least 10 identically named tokens were created in the prior ~9 hours. All now have $0 liquidity and zero h1 volume, which strongly suggests repeated rugs on the same theme.","is_first_or_canonical":"no","ticker_hijack_risk":"high"},"authenticity":{"assessment":"coordinated","evidence":"There are 2,055 unique buyers against 53 unique sellers, and ~1,000 of the buyers arrived within one 15-minute window. That pattern is typical of scripted multi-wallet micro-buys that inflate holder count and volume. Top-10 holders excluding the pool own only 7.66%, which fits dust-sized farmed buys. GMGN also flags 6 bundler wallets. The pool was created directly (not via the curve), the LP is unlocked, and the creator has closed out. Ten dead same-name clones point to a serial operator.","uncertainty":"GMGN reports a 0 bot/degen rate and 0 snipers, and there is no insider network. Some of the buying could be real retail chasing the holiday theme. Without X data, organic interest cannot be confirmed or ruled out."},"market_feasibility":{"assessment":"poor","structural_risks":["$35k of LP is 0% locked/burned, with few LP providers, so the owner can remove liquidity at any time","Liquidity is larger than market cap, which is unusual and consistent with a deployer-seeded pool that can be pulled","10 prior same-name tokens are all at $0 liquidity, a serial rug pattern","The buyer/seller asymmetry points to farmed volume","Price is already fading from its high (ATH 2.99e-5 vs 2.04e-5 now, about -32%)"]},"counterargument":"The festival is literally tomorrow, and Chinese Binance-themed memes have produced real runners. Supply is very dispersed (top holders under 2.3% each), with no dev holdings and no snipers. A $20k market cap only needs about $20k more net buying to double. If the LP provider is not malicious, holiday FOMO in Chinese communities could push it past $40k within hours.","unknowns":["Who holds the LP tokens, and whether they are the creator","Whether the 10 dead clones share a deployer or funder with this token","Whether any real Chinese KOL or community is pushing it","Whether the ~1k-buyer burst was an airdrop or bot farm or real retail"],"source_coverage":{"x_twitter":"not_attempted","reddit":"not_attempted","telegram":"not_attempted","discord":"not_attempted","news":"not_attempted","project_site":"not_attempted","notes":"No internet access in this condition. The judgment is based only on the evidence packet."},"thesis":"This is a coordinated, seasonal clone launch on a directly seeded PumpSwap pool with fully unlocked LP. Ten identical same-name tokens from the past 9 hours have all gone to zero liquidity. The buyer/seller pattern looks farmed. The most likely outcome is that the LP is pulled or the coin bleeds out within 6 hours. A double from a 25-minute-later entry is unlikely.","continuation_view":"strong_fade","p_runner":6,"p_rug":72,"research_confidence":"medium","observation_window":"6h","sources":[]}
